        "statement": "Under n>=1, for every scale r_b with 0<r_b<=1 and every epsilon_b>0 there is a countable cover of F with all diameters at most sqrt(2)*r_b and total (q+1)-cost less than 2*(sqrt(2))^(q+1)*epsilon_b.",
